    "questionText": "Как обрабатывать загрузку файлов в Express.js с помощью Multer?",
    "shortAnswer": "Express не парсит multipart/form-data — нужен Multer. upload.single(field), .array(field,n), .fields([...]). memoryStorage → req.file.buffer; diskStorage → файл на диск. limits fileSize/files и fileFilter по mimetype. MulterError vs custom Error в error middleware. UUID filename — не originalname.",
    "idealAnswer": "multipart/form-data — binary stream с boundary; express.json/urlencoded игнорируют. Multer (Busboy) → req.body fields + req.file/req.files. single/array/fields по сценарию. memoryStorage для resize/S3 upload; diskStorage для static serve. limits: fileSize, files count. fileFilter до buffer — mimetype from client untrusted, check magic bytes. Error: multer.MulterError LIMIT_FILE_SIZE vs fileFilter Error. diskStorage filename UUID not originalname — collision. S3: buffer from memory → putObject. Production: virus scan, size limits, auth before upload.",
    "maxScore": 10,
